    "How do I get to the subway station?": ["How do I get to the subway station?","Go straight two blocks and turn right. You can't miss it.","地下鉄の駅へはどう行けばいいですか？ / 2ブロックまっすぐ行って右に曲がってください。すぐわかりますよ。"],
    "Is it within walking distance?": ["Is the museum within walking distance?","Yeah, it's about a ten-minute walk.","博物館まで歩いて行けますか？ / ええ、歩いて10分くらいです。"],
