    "I'm sorry to hear that.": ["My grandma is in the hospital.","Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. I hope she feels better soon.","おばあちゃんが入院してるんだ。 / そうなんだ、それは心配だね。早くよくなるといいね。"],
    "It's not a big deal.": ["I'm so sorry I spilled your coffee!","It's not a big deal. Don't worry about it.","コーヒーをこぼしちゃって本当にごめん！ / 大したことないよ。気にしないで。"],
    "I love your shoes.": ["I love your shoes! Where did you get them?","Thanks! I got them in Tokyo.","その靴すごくすてき！ どこで買ったの？ / ありがとう！ 東京で買ったんだ。"],
    "Do you want to grab coffee sometime?": ["Do you want to grab coffee sometime?","Sure, I'd love to!","今度コーヒーでもどう？ / いいね、ぜひ！"],
