    "I'll get back to you.": ["Can you join the meeting on Thursday?","Let me check my schedule, and I'll get back to you.","木曜日の会議に参加できますか？ / 予定を確認して、折り返しご連絡します。"],
    "I'm running late.": ["Where are you? The meeting starts in five minutes.","Sorry, I'm running late. I'll be there in ten.","今どこですか？ 会議は5分後に始まりますよ。 / すみません、少し遅れそうです。10分で着きます。"],
