    "pick up": ["Can you pick me up at the airport?","Of course. What time does your flight land?","空港まで迎えに来てくれる？ / もちろん。飛行機は何時に着くの？"],
    "work out": ["You look great! Do you work out?","Yeah, I go to the gym three times a week.","調子よさそうだね！ 運動してるの？ / うん、週3回ジムに行ってるよ。"],
    "It's not my cup of tea.": ["Do you want to go to the jazz concert?","Thanks, but honestly, it's not my cup of tea.","ジャズのコンサートに行かない？ / ありがとう、でも正直、あまり好みじゃないんだ。"],
    "Speak of the devil!": ["Have you seen Mark today?","Speak of the devil! Here he comes.","今日マークを見かけた？ / 噂をすれば！ ほら、来たよ。"],
    "I'm feeling under the weather.": ["Are you coming to the party tonight?","I don't think so. I'm feeling under the weather.","今夜のパーティー来る？ / 行けないと思う。ちょっと体調がすぐれなくて。"],
    "Spill the tea.": ["I heard something crazy about Jen and Mike.","Wait, what? Spill the tea!","ジェンとマイクのすごい話を聞いちゃった。 / え、何？ 詳しく聞かせて！"],
    "No spoilers!": ["Did you finish the show? The ending is...","No spoilers! I'm only on episode 3.","あのドラマ最後まで見た？ ラストがさ… / ネタバレ禁止！ まだ3話なんだから。"],
    "Who's your bias?": ["Who's your bias?","Definitely Ren. What about you?","推しは誰？ / 絶対レン。そっちは？"]
